From 996e3b6cb8fe2a0e12d284fcc1deb3c8758c8296 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:01:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] SEO: add static brand landing pages and link them site-wide

build.js now generates /inventory/<brand>-clanton-al pages for Mahindra, LS,
Bad Boy, IronCraft, Spartan and Bush Hog, with brand-specific title/H1/copy,
every in-stock unit linked in the HTML, and series lists built from inventory.
Brand pages are added to sitemap.xml, item breadcrumbs and related blocks link
to them, and category/browse pages get a shop-by-brand row.

Homepage tiles, lineup 'See In-Stock' buttons and About Us brand pills now
point at the brand pages instead of inventory.html?mfg=, which canonicalises
to /inventory.html. Homepage title now names Clanton and the tractor brands.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
